# gossip store snapshot
# Built 2026-09-15 from PRE-migration code. Every variant of every key, substituted
# as the gossiper sends it: event keys replace {desc} once, fact- keys replace every
# {description}, fallback lines are sent as written. The stand-in description is
# "<the stand-in event>". The pick itself (util.Rand) is not frozen; no test can pin it.
# dimensions: key x variant index

